{"id": "EUVD-2026-98058", "enisaUuid": "adc16568-873b-392f-a38a-0c3c17bd8371", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.111.0 and 16.x before 16.22.0 contains a privilege escalation vulnerability in a record-creation endpoint that takes the record type from the request and inserts the record with permission checks disabled. Any authenticated user, including one holding no operational role, can supply a privileged record type to create privileged accounts and take full control of the site.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T12:41:30", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-x635-wr4c-7345", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.111.0-privilege-escalation-via-unauthorized-record-creation"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109667", "GHSA-f3v4-m95v-25ch"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8cc3d711-33b3-3066-b653-2393afe3c429", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.111.0"}, {"id": "e3a6b5fe-7032-3d38-8607-4474c41754e6", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.22.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "dc09a86a-8264-38c3-88cf-faae75e976cd", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}